├── cosmcare.rs                # Health & wellness benefits engine
├── filmcore.rs                # Film industry royalties & payouts
├── identity_bound_tx.rs       # Identity‑verified transactions (DID-linked)
├── revenue_split.rs           # 88/12 economic split engine
├── cosmagigs.rs               # Gig‑work payouts & loyalty rewards
├── caddiepro.rs               # Sports scoring & ranking system
└── cosmasocial.rs             # Engagement & creator reward engine


Testing
The tests/ folder includes:

Domain contract tests

S3E2C3 protocol tests

Economic logic tests

Identity verification tests

Loyalty reward tests

These ensure correctness, determinism, and protocol alignment.

